span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;network policy &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;live estate, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;operational security controls that keep it defensible as it grows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on senior role with deep technical &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;. This role owns &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;security in production: the technical response to security incidents on the function&#39;s 24/7 security on-call roster, runtime visibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt; and enforcement built with modern &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;eBPF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;-based tooling, the security acceptance requirements a release has to meet before it is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;authorised&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;FIR Body&quot;&gt;, the authority to grant or refuse a security exception, and the deepest technical escalation for security-related platform faults.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:145,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:264}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
