&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GitLab Senior Professional Services Project Managers manage complex projects from initiation through delivery and closure. In this role, you&#39;ll coordinate with cross-functional teams and our global customers to complete distinct projects on time and within budget. You&#39;ll use your experience managing information technology and software consulting projects and your knowledge of traditional and agile project management and software development methods. You&#39;ll also manage executive stakeholder communications, manage escalations, and help improve Professional Services project management practices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage large-scale commercial projects and executive stakeholder meetings and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with GitLab Support, Engineering, and Product teams to resolve complex customer problems using GitLab technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements to Professional Services project management tools, processes, procedures, and templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Summarize key customer projects monthly and provide a summary for quarterly business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage delivery schedules, customer expectations, project scope, resources, status, risks, and issues for technical and consulting services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage customer escalations by coordinating with customers and GitLab stakeholders, including the executive team, Sales, and Technical Account Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reliable, repeatable delivery processes, metrics, and operational procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and achieve forecast goals by aligning customers, Technical Architects, project engineers, partner consultants, and delivery partners.&lt;/li&gt;
