&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Renewals Manager at GitLab, you&#39;ll own renewal planning and execution for public sector customers. You&#39;ll develop renewal strategies, forecast outcomes, and coordinate with Sales and Customer Success to address risks and support long-term customer relationships. You&#39;ll also improve renewal workflows so customers experience seamless continuity with GitLab&#39;s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some examples of our projects:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Implementing automated outreach sequences to engage customers throughout their renewal lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Enhancing customer experience by integrating adoption data and personalized communications into renewal processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Own the renewal process for a portfolio of public sector customers, developing account-level strategies and coordinating renewal activities from planning through completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with public sector Sales and Customer Success teams to align on renewal plans, address customer risks, and ensure seamless renewal experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Monitor customer health and adoption data to forecast renewal opportunities accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Execute outreach campaigns through established sequences, personalizing communications to maintain strong customer relationships and drive on-time renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Drive customer retention and timely renewals, taking ownership of renewal risks and coordinating actions to resolve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience owning customer renewal strategies, managing competing priorities, and improving renewal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience working in a collaborative, customer-facing environment where you coordinate with multiple internal teams to support renewal forecasting and customer retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CRM and customer success tools such as Salesforce and Gainsight, and the ability to interpret customer health and adoption data to inform renewal strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with confidence to engage in business conversations and deliver excellent customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Demonstrated discipline in time and project management, with the ability to prioritize outreach and renewal activities effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Openness to learning and adapting, with a coachable mindset and willingness to implement feedback for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Customer-centric approach with high empathy, focused on building long-term relationships and driving customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We welcome candidates from diverse backgrounds who can demonstrate the experience and transferable skills needed to own renewal outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Renewals team at GitLab manages the end-to-end renewal process for a large portfolio of customers and is dedicated to driving customer retention and growth. Our mission is to support long-term customer success through data-driven insights and close collaboration with Customer Success and Sales teams to proactively engage customers, identify risks and opportunities, and ensure timely renewals. We operate in a global, asynchronous environment, using tools like Salesforce, Gainsight, and Gong to coordinate efforts and maintain high standards of customer satisfaction. Learn more about our approach and best practices in the &lt;a class=&quot;textLink&quot; href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/customer-success/renewals-managers/home/&quot;&gt;Renewals Manager Handbook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
